                "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262695661",
                "is_external_url": true,
                "author": "hworldstudios",
                "contents": "Developer Update #1: SYSTEMS ONLINE WELCOMEHello! If you're reading this then you're one of the very first people to discover BELTFED. And although it's just been announced, it's been in the works since 2023. It's really cool to finally show off what we've been working hard on for the last three years. If you're interested in BELTFED, wishlist it on Steam. ABOUT BELTFEDBELTFED is a roguelike automation game with crazy scale. You'll experience the full automation game arc, from first belts down to end-game insanity, in a single gaming session. BELTFED condenses the greatest this genre has to offer into a fast-paced, action-packed run. This game is for both those who are interested in the genre but don't have the time to dedicate themselves to a more traditional title, and for factory builder vets looking for a new challenge with a crazy change in pace. BELTFED is in a playable state, and we've had some really successful playtests. We're currently working on what we've scoped out for the public demo, and we'll post updates about that along the way. GET INVOLVEDChat with us, read frequent progress updates and share your thoughts and ideas on our Discord server. WHAT'S NEXT?Trailer goes live very soonGameplay video shortly after thatSteam page localization is in progressOur main focus is the public demo - more info on this soonWe'll continue to post updates here and on Discord PRESS / INFLUENCER?If you're a member of the press, a content creator or influencer who's interested in covering BELTFED, please feel free to reach out to me directly at troy@helloworldstudios.io. We also have a presskit with a bunch of info, videos, screenshots etc. that you can use as you please. Can't wait for you to play BELTFED. - Troy",
